WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
En el carril de filtros crea Input Control. Elige AIN360_ORDER_FINANCE, Dimensions, Product y Filter by Member. Marca All Members y confirma OK.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:46.400
En More Actions de Product abre Linked Analysis, Settings. Elige Only Selected Widgets y Main_Lane_1. Aplica y guarda.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:01:19.600
Quita Soft Drinks y pulsa Apply Selections. La serie cambia y los KPIs no. Vuelve a All, aplica y guarda.
